## Why This Is Asked
Tests bridging basics, event emitters, and lifecycle safety in a practical beginner task.

## Key Concepts
- React Native bridge modules (iOS/Android)
- Event emission vs method calls
- Lifecycle cleanup to avoid memory leaks
